From: Canonical endpoint audit <audit@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:53:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! chronik: offload ChronikValidationInterface callbacks
 to dedicated worker thread

Bound retained Chronik callback payloads and executing task by 256 MiB and 65,536 tasks. Overflow or worker exception requests orderly node shutdown without blocking the shared scheduler; accepted events drain FIFO. Preserve SyncTransactionQueue fence through submitted/completed sequence tracking. This intentionally favors fail-closed consistency over service availability at overload.
